# Overview Page
guide.adversity.overview.title=Welcome to Adversity
guide.adversity.overview.intro=Adversity adds progressive challenges to Minecraft. As you explore further and survive longer, monsters become stronger and more dangerous. This guide will help you understand the mechanics and find counterplay strategies.
guide.adversity.overview.difficulty=Difficulty System
guide.adversity.overview.difficulty.desc=Difficulty is based on two factors: distance from spawn and play time. The further you go and the longer you survive, the harder it gets. Difficulty ranges from 1.0 to 10.0.
guide.adversity.overview.elites=Elite Mobs
guide.adversity.overview.elites.desc=Mobs in high-difficulty areas may become "elites". Elite mobs have more health, deal more damage, and carry special affix abilities. Killing elites yields rare drops.
guide.adversity.overview.affixes=Affix System
guide.adversity.overview.affixes.desc=Elite mobs carry Affixes - special abilities like Fiery (burning attacks), Frosty (freeze effect), Teleporting, etc. Affixes are categorized as Offensive, Defensive, Utility, or Special.
guide.adversity.overview.counterplay=Counterplay Options
guide.adversity.overview.counterplay.desc=This mod provides multiple counterplay options: Sanctuaries provide safe zones, Baubles offer passive protection, Enchantments enhance equipment. Using these mechanics wisely is key to survival!

# Sanctuary Page
guide.adversity.sanctuary.title=Sanctuary System
guide.adversity.sanctuary.intro=Sanctuaries are safe zones that significantly reduce elite spawns and enhance your bauble effects. There are two types: Natural and Artificial.

guide.adversity.sanctuary.natural=Natural Sanctuary
guide.adversity.sanctuary.natural.desc=Natural sanctuaries are underground quartz shrines with indestructible altars and surrounding blocks, providing strong protection.
guide.adversity.sanctuary.natural.find=Location: Natural sanctuaries generate every ~1000 blocks at Y=32 in underground quartz shrines
guide.adversity.sanctuary.natural.activate=Activation: Right-click the Sanctuary Altar, requires entropy items as fuel
guide.adversity.sanctuary.natural.effect=Effect: Completely blocks elite spawns, bauble effects at 100%%

guide.adversity.sanctuary.artificial=Artificial Sanctuary
guide.adversity.sanctuary.artificial.desc=Artificial sanctuaries are player-built structures that provide moderate protection.
guide.adversity.sanctuary.artificial.build=Construction: 3x3x3 stone brick structure with Sanctuary Core in center
guide.adversity.sanctuary.artificial.materials=Materials: Sanctuary Core crafted with obsidian + chiseled stone brick + Entropy Core
guide.adversity.sanctuary.artificial.effect=Effect: Reduces elite spawn chance by 50%%, bauble effects at 80%%

guide.adversity.sanctuary.entropy=Entropy Fuel
guide.adversity.sanctuary.entropy.desc=Sanctuaries require entropy items as fuel to operate. Entropy items drop from elite mobs.
guide.adversity.sanctuary.entropy.shard=Entropy Shard: Basic fuel (10 points), drops from T1-T4 elites
guide.adversity.sanctuary.entropy.crystal=Entropy Crystal: Medium fuel (50 points), drops from T5-T7 elites or crafted from shards
guide.adversity.sanctuary.entropy.core=Entropy Core: High fuel (200 points), drops from T8-T10 elites or crafted from crystals

# Baubles Page
guide.adversity.baubles.title=Ward Baubles
guide.adversity.baubles.intro=Ward baubles are special equipment items that protect you from specific affix effects. Their effects are significantly enhanced within sanctuary zones!

guide.adversity.baubles.equipment=Equipment Ward
guide.adversity.baubles.soul_chain=Soul Chain: Protects against Shackle (armor seal), 100%% immunity in sanctuary
guide.adversity.baubles.spatial_anchor=Spatial Anchor: Protects against Divest (bauble seal), grants attack boost on block
guide.adversity.baubles.enchant_guardian=Enchant Guardian: Protects against Disenchant, restores XP on block

guide.adversity.baubles.elemental=Elemental Ward
guide.adversity.baubles.flame_ward=Flame Ward: Protects against Fiery burn stacks, auto-clears at max
guide.adversity.baubles.frost_ward=Frost Ward: Protects against Frosty freeze, brief invincibility on trigger
guide.adversity.baubles.corrosion_bane=Corrosion Bane: Protects against Withering corrosion, reflects damage at max

guide.adversity.baubles.special=Special Ward
guide.adversity.baubles.guardian_heart=Guardian Heart: Protects against permanent curses (Black Swan/Friday/Coffin)
guide.adversity.baubles.anchor_stone=Anchor Stone: Protects against Gravity pull, trade-off: reduced move speed
guide.adversity.baubles.clarity_lens=Clarity Lens: Protects against Blinding vision loss, trade-off: position shared
guide.adversity.baubles.courage_charm=Courage Charm: Protects against Horror fear, trade-off: increased fear damage

guide.adversity.baubles.sanctuary_bonus=Sanctuary Bonus
guide.adversity.baubles.sanctuary_bonus.desc=Within sanctuary zones, all bauble protection effects are amplified based on sanctuary type. Natural sanctuaries provide 100%% effect (full immunity), artificial sanctuaries provide 80%%. Outside sanctuary, effects drop to base value (~30-50%%).

# Enchantments Page
guide.adversity.enchants.title=Anti-Adversity Enchants
guide.adversity.enchants.intro=These special enchantments help you combat elite mobs and affix effects. Obtainable at enchanting tables or through other means.

guide.adversity.enchants.list=Enchantment List
guide.adversity.enchants.soulbound=Soulbound: Keep item on death, won't drop
guide.adversity.enchants.breaker=Breaker: Attacks may remove one affix buff from elites
guide.adversity.enchants.entropy_affinity=Entropy Affinity: Increases entropy item drops from elites
guide.adversity.enchants.purifying_touch=Purifying Touch: Attacks reduce remaining seal token duration
guide.adversity.enchants.resolute_will=Resolute Will: Chance to gain brief invincibility when hit by elites

# Tips Page
guide.adversity.tips.title=Survival Tips
guide.adversity.tips.beginner=Beginner Tips
guide.adversity.tips.beginner.1=Don't venture too far early! Stay within 500 blocks of spawn for safety
guide.adversity.tips.beginner.2=Prioritize collecting entropy shards - they're key resources for progression
guide.adversity.tips.beginner.3=Activate natural sanctuaries immediately - they become forward bases for exploration

guide.adversity.tips.advanced=Advanced Strategies
guide.adversity.tips.advanced.1=Combine baubles and enchantments to counter most affix combinations
guide.adversity.tips.advanced.2=Build an artificial sanctuary network in high-difficulty areas for safe retreat
guide.adversity.tips.advanced.3=Watch for dangerous affix combos (Fiery+Frosty, Shackle+Divest)

guide.adversity.tips.danger=Danger Warnings
guide.adversity.tips.danger.1=Permanent curses (Black Swan/Friday/Coffin) are most dangerous - always carry Guardian Heart!
guide.adversity.tips.danger.2=T8+ elites are extremely dangerous - don't challenge without full preparation

